The only things I bother with #adjusting the letters of are tools and 
armor, the first since I'm needing to apply them frequently, the second 
to make dressing and undressing easier (for trying on new armor, 
enchanting a particular piece, etc.) I mostly use first initials, but do 
it by function, not necessarily by actual name.

Herewith the list:

b - bag
c - expensive camera
g - can of grease
k - key, lock pick, or credit card
l - lamp or lantern
m - magic marker
p - pickaxe
s - stethescope
t - blindfold or towel
u - unihorn
w - whistle

A - suit of armor
B - boots
C - Cloak
G - Gloves
H - Helmet
R - Robe (sometimes, if I swap with another cloak)
T - Hawaiian shirt or T-Shirt

